 Lead 
 Push 
 API For: 
 Lead 
 push API is used to insert the Lead in Farvision from Website/third party 
 sources. Following are the steps that need to be followed for integration. 
 Step1: 
 Create 
 Token 
 and API 
 Key from Admin module. The created token and API Key will be sent 
 to the given email id. 
 Step2: Tag the Origin, 
 Product and Campaign to the created token from Lead 
 push API Mapping . Here the Description given in Token will be populated 
 in 'ProviderName'. 
 Step3: Share the token, API Key and API URL to the concerned developer to integrate. 
